      "id": 2093,
      "hub_id": 2778,
      "guid": "com.colo.vcq",
      "name": "Virtual's Custom Quests - Updated",
      "slug": "virtuals-custom-quests-updated",
      "teaser": "A set of custom lore-based quests to fill that deep desire for more content.",
      "thumbnail": "",
      "downloads": 18301,
      "favourites_count": 18,
      "description": "<p><strong>A set of custom lore-based quests to fill that deep desire for more content.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>If anyone wants to do translations feel free to contact me.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Overview</strong></p>\n<p>A custom set of 40 quests that range in difficulty to vary the playthrough of Tarkov just a little bit more. The quests are relatively lore-friendly, some are an addition to the game’s current set of lore-based quests and appears just as new content (A new player wouldn’t be able to tell they aren’t the base game content). The rest is a mastery set that requires the player to move through different levels of elimination quests with various weapons and yield some worthy rewards.</p>\n<p>Originally by Virtual, updated with his permission.</p>\n<p>Contains translations for German users.</p>\n<p><strong>Installation</strong></p>\n<p>Download the file for your version of SPT and extract to your SPT install. The files will then be placed in their relevant locations.</p>\n<p>If you are using the version for SPT 3.* you will need VCQL.</p>\n<p>If you are using the version for SPT 4.* you will need WTTCommonLib.</p>\n",
      "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2093/virtuals-custom-quests-updated",
